.helix/

# Aider AI Chat
.aider*

# Generated documentation
#
# The guide is a build artefact: `vmmsx/docs/` is the source, `/docs/` is the
# .docx it produces. Committing the binary would put a file nobody can diff
# under review, and it goes stale the moment a field changes. Regenerate it
# instead — see the documentation rule in CLAUDE.md.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `docs/` matches at any depth
# and would ignore the generator's own source alongside its output.
/docs/

# Assistant instructions
#
# CLAUDE.md is working guidance for whoever is editing this app, not part of
# what the app ships. Kept on disk and out of the repository, the same way
# onerc_payments keeps its own. Anchored to the root so a future one nested in
# a module is a deliberate decision rather than an accident of this rule.
/CLAUDE.md
